<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - U.S. Filter started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - U.S. Filter started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney initiated coverage of U.S. Filter Corp with a buy rating, a Smith Barney source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- U.S. Filter gained 1-1/2 to 35-3/8 in early morning trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
